# Browser
# Changeling (CR 702.73a) gives Firdoch Core every creature type, about three hundred. A player reads the card as it is
# printed - "Kindred Artifact - Shapeshifter" - and the page says the rest in words, "every creature type", instead of
# printing the whole set: in hand, on the battlefield and animated alike. The engine still has the whole set (the
# `Subtypes` check below), which the page keeps for a question like "is it a Pirate?".

